          "quote": "急诊和心内科会根据现在的具体情况重新安排用药。等会诊完成后，医生会告诉您接下来吃什么、怎么吃。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00143",
          "explanation": "Doctor states that final diagnosis and medication reconciliation require offline evaluation.",
          "quote": "线下医生说后面按医院医嘱用药，没让我们自己拿家里的药给他吃，这点我记住了。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model closes the episode by clearly stating that the current online task is safely transitioned only because the patient is in emergency care; lists unresolved risks (syncope cause, ECG/troponin/renal results, medication confusion); specifies what information to hand to the receiving team; and provides explicit deterioration instructions. This goes beyond minimum RC7 receipt by classifying the handoff as a bounded safety transition rather than a final diagnosis.",
